# AI-Assisted Aircraft Emergency Cabin Separation Prototype

## Overview

This project presents a tabletop research prototype for an
AI-assisted emergency aircraft cabin-separation concept.

The prototype combines:

- Aircraft-condition sensors
- AI-based emergency-state classification
- ESP32 control
- Electromagnetic actuation
- Mechanical latch
- Detachable lightweight model cabin

## Important Safety Notice

This is a research and educational prototype for a tabletop model.

It is NOT designed, tested, or certified for use on real aircraft,
passenger aircraft, or human transportation.

The electromagnetic actuator operates a small mechanical latch.
It does not provide the force required to separate an aircraft
structure.

